      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-11-18 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\nOpenAIが次世代フラッグシップ「GPT-6.2 Astra」および日常タスク向け「GPT-6.2 Sol」を発表\n\n[出典リンク](https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol/)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/OpenAI|OpenAI]]\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/NVIDIA|NVIDIA]]\n- [[Entities/Perplexity|Perplexity]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/GPT|GPT]]\n- [[Technologies/chain-of-thought|chain-of-thought]]\n- [[Technologies/Docker|Docker]]"
    },
